BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pierrot le Fou (1965)
DTSTART:20261111T033000Z
DTEND:20261111T053500Z
DTSTAMP:20261111T033000Z
UID:2Iwpxo12vu
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 110 mins (1h50m)\n\nNouvelles FemmesA husband (Jean-
 Paul Belmondo) flees his shallow Paris life with the babysitter (Anna Kari
 na)\, to French Riviera escapades with gangsters\, stolen loot\, sunny hed
 onism\, political commentary\; a charming disorder\, a reflection of direc
 tor Godard's and Karina’s stormy marriage. It’s truly moving when he h
 as her gaze into our/his camera’s eyes.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs
 -and-events/nouvelles-femmes/pierrot-le-fou\n\nEstimated start: 19:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sweetheart
DTSTART:20261119T020000Z
DTEND:20261119T035000Z
DTSTAMP:20261119T020000Z
UID:4iMLMovXCB
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 92 mins (1h32m)\n\nCinema Italian Style 2026 Presen
 ted by Cinema Italian Style. A reluctant summer together transforms into 
 an enchanting adventure when a young boy discovers his aunt's mysterious S
 icilian household's secrets and\, perhaps\, ancient spirits lurking within
  its walls.After the screening: Join us for the Opening Night Party at KEX
 P! Make sure to purchase the “Movie + Party” ticket to attend.\n\nhttp
 s://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/cinema-italian-style-2026/sweetheart
 \n\nEstimated start: 18:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Heart of the Game (2005)
DTSTART:20261115T220000Z
DTEND:20261115T235500Z
DTSTAMP:20261115T220000Z
UID:i0XKh7Aujf
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 97 mins (1h37m)\n\nWhen a maverick college tax profe
 ssor takes over as coach and revitalizes Seattle’s struggling Roosevelt 
 High School girls’ basketball team\, he is challenged by its embattled s
 tar\, Darnellia\, and her legal battle to play the game that means everyth
 ing to her. 20th anniversary screening. Post-film Q&A with Director Ward S
 errill.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/the-heart-of-the-game\n
 \nEstimated start: 14:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:My Night at Maud's (1969)
DTSTART:20261118T033000Z
DTEND:20261118T053000Z
DTSTAMP:20261118T033000Z
UID:iFjuR2vZHl
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 105 mins (1h45m)\n\nNouvelles FemmesFate and chance 
 entwine as a man (Jean-Louis Trintignant)\, convinced he’ll marry a woma
 n he’s never met (Marie-Christine Barrault)\, is unexpectedly side-track
 ed into an evening with Maud (Françoise Fabienne)\, a desirable paragon o
 f education\, culture\, challenging conversation\, career stability\, and 
 bedroom eyes.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/nouvelles-femmes
 /my-night-at-mauds\n\nEstimated start: 19:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
