DTEND:20261120T060000Z
DTSTAMP:20261120T040000Z
UID:XgQSeHodg7
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 102 mins (1h42m)\n\nCinema Italian Style 2026 Prese
 nted by Cinema Italian Style. In 2007\, Fred moves to Trieste with her fa
 ther\, enrolling in Technical High School. She becomes the only girl in an
  all-male class\, disrupting friends Antero\, Pasini\, and Mitis' secret d
 esire for her.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/cinema-italian-
 style-2026/a-year-of-school\n\nEstimated start: 20:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
