DTSTART:20261120T230000Z
DTEND:20261121T011500Z
DTSTAMP:20261120T230000Z
UID:dYEbnHBt3V
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 120 mins (2h00m)\n\nCinema Italian StylePresented by
  Cinema Italian Style. A farmer's son transforms into a fashion mogul\, b
 uilding a billion-dollar luxury empire while staying true to his humanisti
 c values and commitment to ethical business practices and fine craftsmansh
 ip.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/cinema-italian-style-2026/
 brunello-the-gracious-visionary\n\nEstimated start: 15:15
