BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Last One for the Road
DTSTART:20261121T040000Z
DTEND:20261121T055500Z
DTSTAMP:20261121T040000Z
UID:IKBagISjeL
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 98 mins (1h38m)\n\nCinema Italian StylePresented by 
 Cinema Italian Style. Two blustery 50-somethings have an obsession: going
  for their last drink. One night\, they run into Giulio\, a shy architectu
 re student\, whose way of seeing the world and love will be transformed as
  the trio wander from bar to bar in Veneto.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/progra
 ms-and-events/cinema-italian-style-2026/the-last-one-for-the-road\n\nEstim
 ated start: 20:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Journey to Italy (1954)
DTSTART:20261122T210000Z
DTEND:20261122T225500Z
DTSTAMP:20261122T210000Z
UID:2ivsXPXSlv
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 97 mins (1h37m)\n\nCinema Italian StylePresented by 
 Cinema Italian Style. After ten years of marriage\, Alexander and Katheri
 ne have grown weary of routine and begin to question their love. A journey
  to Naples\, sparked by an unexpected inheritance\, plunges them into a wo
 rld of passion\, chaos\, and discovery\, forcing them to confront what sti
 ll binds them together.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/cinema
 -italian-style-2026/journey-to-italy\n\nEstimated start: 13:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
