BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:God Forgives Everyone
DTSTART:20261123T013000Z
DTEND:20261123T034000Z
DTSTAMP:20261123T013000Z
UID:bY3MpZVrhM
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 113 mins (1h53m)\n\nCinema Italian StylePresented by
  Cinema Italian Style. Arturo\, a Palermo real estate agent obsessed with
  Sicilian pastries\, falls for Flora\, a devout Catholic. To win her heart
 \, he embraces religion in an unexpected way\, turning Gospel teachings in
 to daily actions\, with the Pope as his unlikely spiritual mentor.\n\nhttp
 s://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/cinema-italian-style-2026/god-forgive
 s-everyone\n\nEstimated start: 17:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Where is the Fiesta?
DTSTART:20261121T230000Z
DTEND:20261122T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20261121T230000Z
UID:LFLn76LNh7
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 102 mins (1h42m)\n\nCinema Italian StylePresented by
  Cinema Italian Style. Leo and Irene have been dating for three months and
  they have not yet faced that moment\, the one in which one asks: What are
  the two of us? In a few days it will be New Year's Eve and friends are pr
 essing on: the time has come to clarify.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-
 and-events/cinema-italian-style-2026/where-is-the-fiesta\n\nEstimated star
 t: 15:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Kidnapping of Arabella
DTSTART:20261122T013000Z
DTEND:20261122T033500Z
DTSTAMP:20261122T013000Z
UID:41w1rFpoUr
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 107 mins (1h47m)\n\nCinema Italian StylePresented by
  Cinema Italian Style. Holly\, trapped in a dead-end job\, believes meeti
 ng rebellious eight-year-old Arabella is a cosmic second chance: her young
 er self returned. Together they embark on an unconventional road trip\, di
 scovering that two lost souls may hold the answers each has been searching
  for. Following the screening: Q&A with the film's director\, Carolina Ca
 valli\, a guest of Cinema Italian Style.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-
 and-events/cinema-italian-style-2026/the-kidnapping-of-arabella\n\nEstimat
 ed start: 17:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
